'''Richard''' is an [[NPC]] in the {{zone|Trade Center}} that hosts auctions for {{Item|Stock of Stonks}}. Auctions are held every [[SkyBlock Month]], provided that {{NPC|Diaz}} is elected with her {{AN|Stock Exchange}} perk.

