{{/UI}}

== Stonks Auctions ==
{{green|1}} → {{green|25}} {{item|Stock of Stonks|text=Stocks of Stonks}} can be purchased from {{NPC|Richard}}'s [[Stonks Auction]], depending on the amount of {{C}} bid and {{red|placement}} relative to other players, with a minimum of {{C|2,000,000}}.
