=== Timing ===
Since [[Mayor Elections]] end on {{Season|m=LSP|d=27th}} of every SkyBlock year:
*{{green|13}} Stonks Auctions take place, the majority lasting {{green|10}} hours and {{green|20}} minutes.
*the 1st one ends a mere {{green|80}} minutes after {{NPCSprite|Diaz}} is elected;
*the 13th and last one ends on {{Season|m=LSP|d=27th}} of the following year, making it {{green|540 minutes}}, or {{green|80 minutes}} shorter than the majority of the auctions.

